  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline A5 is a premium round co-polyester engineered for precision, stability and elite spin without relying on aggressive shaped edges. Its refined polymer blend produces exceptional snapback, low-friction response and strong tension stability. Because round strings naturally create less mechanical ball grip, A5 generates much of its spin through rapid string movement, elasticity and powerful snapback. Racketpedia laboratory testing cited by Toroline rated A5 a perfect 100/100 for spin, making it the brand's highest-rated round string for spin performance. Its symmetrical geometry also produces a clean, predictable launch angle and repeatable ball flight. The 1.20 mm Infrared version provides a livelier response and greater feel, while the 1.25 mm Carbon Gray version emphasizes stability and control.",

    "zh": "Toroline A5 是一款高端圆形共聚酯球线，核心定位是精准、稳定、Connected Feel 与极高旋转表现。由于圆形球线缺少异形线锐利边缘提供的机械咬球，A5 主要依靠极高 Snapback、低摩擦、弹性以及快速线床回位来制造旋转。Toroline 引用的 Racketpedia 实验室测试中，A5 的旋转评分达到满分 100/100，使其成为 Toroline 旋转评分最高的圆形球线。对称圆形结构同时能够提供非常稳定、可预测的 Launch Angle 与重复性极高的球路。1.20 毫米 Infrared 版本更加活跃、强调手感与回弹；1.25 毫米 Carbon Gray 版本则更偏向稳定、控制与耐久。"
  },

